UniProt Consortium
================================================================================

(c) 2002-2024 UniProt Consortium

UniProt data is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The UniProt Consortium states that it cannot grant unrestricted permission for
all uses of its data, because some of it may be subject to third-party rights
